export const GROUTIX_QUOTE_TERMS = `Groutix Terms and Conditions (Full text at https://groutix.com.au/terms-conditions)

1. Definitions: Customer, Supplier (Groutix Pty Ltd ACN 687 415 005), Completion Date, Contract, Quotation, Site, Variation, Work.
2. Binding terms: Only terms set out herein or imposed by law are binding.
3. Quotations & scope: Prices valid for 30 days. Work based on visual assessment. Customer must keep work areas dry for at least 24 hours before work starts and 24 hours after completion (do not use shower for 24h prior).
4. Plumbing & painting: Excluded unless expressly stated.
5. GST: Prices exclude GST unless expressly stated.
6. Acceptance: Customer must inspect work upon completion; 7 days written notice for any claim.
7. Payment: Payment due in full on date of sale. $30 late fee per 7-day period + 2% per month interest + collection/legal costs on overdue accounts.
8. Cancellation fee: Cancellations within 10 business days incur a $350 cancellation fee (incl GST) plus committed materials/subcontractor costs.
9. Latent defects & site conditions: Supplier not liable for latent framework, membrane, substrate defects. Access, electricity, water, and parking to be provided by Customer.
10. Time for completion: Reasonable time with extensions for matters beyond Supplier's control.
11. Variations: Agreed in writing with price/time adjustment.
12. Warranties & exclusions: (1) Qualifying full shower epoxy regrouting: 10 years from Completion Date against application/workmanship failure. (2) Polymer/cement grout: 2 years. (3) Silicone/caulking: 2 years. Warranty excluded if cracked, loose, hollow or drummy tiles are present (shower as a whole excluded). Concealed defects, building movement, membrane failure, plumbing leaks excluded.
13. Notice of warranty claim: Written notice within 10 business days of defect with inspection opportunity.
14. Termination & suspension: 10 business days remedy notice for material breach.
15. Authority: Person accepting warrants authority to bind Customer.
16. Disputes: Direct resolution followed by mediation.
17. Privacy: Consent for credit enquiries if credit is supplied.
18. Severability & Entire understanding: Governed by the laws of Victoria / Australia.

By accepting this quotation, the Customer agrees to these Terms & Conditions.
Full Terms & Conditions: https://groutix.com.au/terms-conditions
Stay Sealed. Stay Smiling.`;

